      "content": "thanks for that. i noticed you used words like \"vital step\" and \"clear priority\" for the environmental side, but then you basically just brushed off the business concerns as something they're just \"voicing.\" \n\npeople in the downtown area are actually really upset about this, and some of the business owners feel like their livelihood is being ignored. can you rewrite it to be a bit more balanced? i don't want the newsletter to sound like the city has already made up its mind before the vote even happens.",
